# Routes 26 and 27, their houses and the League's reception gate: HeartGold gives the roads from New Bark Town to the
# League one theme (SEQ_GS_R_1_26), and this game a song of its own: a bold trumpet in B-flat major marching over a
# rolling harp, held strings and a striding bass, the long road east by the sea toward the Pokémon League. Original
# composition for this game (plan 20 · J10, part b).
